API Documentation
http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html

How to Run
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run

POST /api/cart/items
{
    "productId": "string",
    "quantity": 1
}

PUT /api/cart/item/{id}
{
    "quantity": 3
}

DELETE /api/cart/item/{id}
returns 200

Custom exceptions include:
    InvalidQuantityException
    CartItemNotFoundException

